  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.1 — Internal cleanup, no behavior change\n\nMaintenance patch on the 1.1.0 line. **100% backwards compatible** — the public API surface, defaults and behavior are untouched.\n\n- Internal deduplication: the pen-test signal scoring and the verdict-to-action mapping now live once in the shared internal helpers that both detectors call, so a score or a mapping can only change in one place\n- Internal code-quality cleanup with no behavior change\n- Development-only dependencies refreshed to their latest stable releases\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md and docs/ for full details.",
